    "detailed_description": "In My Lovely Dog Adventure you play as a little dog that discovers the world on its mission to find its friend. <br><br>Travel the world as a little Corgi! You wander mysterious and different landscapes in search of your beloved friend, collecting shiny chrystals on the way. <br>Find out what caused the petrification of the humans and find a way to undo the curse that befell them!<br><br>It's a short emotional story-driven exploration game that will keep you interested with an immersive story and stunning environments.<br><br>What to expect:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Exploration<br></li><li> An emotional story<br></li><li> Collecting chrystals<br></li><li> Beautiful landscapes</li></ul>",
